c early voting\n- the poll data shows huge amounts of early voting\n- I did early voting in Houston and the line was as long as when Obama ran the first time\n- Texas requires ID to cast a vote\n- I am 100% white and have had poll workers make me redo my signature because it didnt match their records\n- Most Texas counties are Red and so the voting is controlled by our team\n- (R) lost all across Texas not just huge unreal numbers in the cities\n- Shit-tard liberals came out to vote against Elon, ICE, datacenters and Trump\n- Dems have been hyping up their voters every day for years.  Not months, years.\n- Dems regularly hold GOTV related activities.\n- there were some people on our side 'sounding the alarm' before the election, because they knew the numbers were bad\n\n\nif there is a case for voter fraud I think Trump would be making it.\n\nDems turned out in huge numbers for retarded reasons.\n\nBidens win was weird for a dozen different reasons.  \n\nIf you have a voter fraud case make it not just \"these numbers seem unreal\".\n\nThere will always be a handful of places where something goes wrong or is fishy.  Dems swept Texas - where (R) control almost everything.", "author": "try4gain", "created": 1793983110171, "profile_picture": "FHNIuGu0hRXm", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Comntrinchief", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "ELECTION FRAUD THREAD", "last_comment_created": 1794002947792, "content": "<ul>\n<li>none of the major candidates are saying something fishy happened</li>\n<li>trump is not saying there was fraud (except Alaska)</li>\n<li>all week the news reported historic early voting</li>\n<li>the poll data shows huge amounts of early voting</li>\n<li>I did early voting in Houston and the line was as long as when Obama ran the first time</li>\n<li>Texas requires ID to cast a vote</li>\n<li>I am 100% white and have had poll workers make me redo my signature because it didnt match their records</li>\n<li>Most Texas counties are Red and so the voting is controlled by our team</li>\n<li>(R) lost all across Texas not just huge unreal numbers in the cities</li>\n<li>Shit-tard liberals came out to vote against Elon, ICE, datacenters and Trump</li>\n<li>Dems have been hyping up their voters every day for years.  Not months, years.</li>\n<li>Dems regularly hold GOTV related activities.</li>\n<li>there were some people on our side 'sounding the alarm' before the election, because they knew the numbers were bad</li>\n</ul>\n<p>if there is a case for voter fraud I think Trump would be making it.</p>\n<p>Dems turned out in huge numbers for retarded reasons.</p>\n<p>Bidens win was weird for a dozen different reasons.</p>\n<p>If you have a voter fraud case make it not just &quot;these numbers seem unreal&quot;.</p>\n<p>There will always be a handful of places where something goes wrong or is fishy.  Dems swept Texas - where (R) control almost everything.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 13, "score_up": 55, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f\u00a0\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f\u00a0SPICY\u00a0\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f\u00a0\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToZ25lem", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 27, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8927384, "raw_content": "", "author": "RINO_fatigue", "created": 1793997341567, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author":